<petr. afr. 6.778>	Fluctibus hinc, illinc inopini fraudibus hostis
<petr. afr. 6.779>	Vincuntur facile; paucas maris abstulit estus
<petr. afr. 6.780>	Demersitque alias; plures rapuere nefandi
<petr. afr. 6.781>	Predones. Medias Octavius ipse procellas
