<petr. afr. 7.42>	Hanibalem fratremque oculis Respublica letis
<petr. afr. 7.43>	Cerneret, ast alia urgebat precordia cura:
<petr. afr. 7.44>	Segnities suspecta ducum, quibus omne Senatus
<petr. afr. 7.45>	Mandarat studium ne quo molimine possent
